WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 3.6 · Structure, Governance & Accountability
Decision rights and delegation of authority

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Write down who can approve what, up to which limit, before you open a bank account or sign a contract.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Set approval limits that rise with the risk.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Add a second signatory, even if you are only two.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Name who approves when someone is away or conflicted.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You draft your first delegation matrix with absence and conflict rules.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
